      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nfetch_recent_logs.py - retrieves recent log results filtered by field values and time range\nincident_summary.py - Summarize error-log findings for incident review\nlog_embedding.py - Embed selected log messages for semantic retrieval\nlog_message_translate.py - Translate support-visible log messages for another locale\nlog_text_safety.py - Check selected log message text for unsafe content\nobservability_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Managed Log Query / Log Ingestion\nobservability_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Managed Log Query / Log Ingestion\nquery_error_logs.py - queries recent error log entries filtered by severity and time range\nwrite_correlated_logs.py - writes application log events that include a shared request or correlation identifier\nwrite_structured_log.py - writes a structured JSON log event to a managed logging service\n\nCreate write_structured_log.py in the current working directory.\nTask: writes a structured JSON log event to a managed logging service.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
